Goal: To find any association between tumour mutational burden and progression free survival in NSCLC

The data came from publicly available dataset from cBioPortal, which can be resued and redistributed under the Open Database License

1. MSK PD-1 NSCLC (2018)
   https://www.cbioportal.org/study/clinicalData?id=nsclc_pd1_msk_2018

2. MSKCC NSCLC Brain Metastases (2023)
   https://www.cbioportal.org/study/clinicalData?id=bm_nsclc_mskcc_2023

3. TRACERx NSCLC (2017)
   https://www.cbioportal.org/study/clinicalData?id=nsclc_tracerx_2017

4. TCGA Lung Adenocarcinoma (PanCancer Atlas)
   https://www.cbioportal.org/study/clinicalData?id=luad_tcga_pan_can_atlas_2018

5. TCGA Lung Squamous Cell Carcinoma (PanCancer Atlas)
   https://www.cbioportal.org/study/clinicalData?id=lusc_tcga_pan_can_atlas_2018
